      "openalex_id": "W4323363721",
      "doi": "10.1177/14782103231162181",
      "title": "A subject\u2019s autonomy: Undidactic mediation in Georg Luk\u00e1cs and John Dewey",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "John Baldacchino",
